oimisuuteen, itsetuntemukseen ja kaikkien mukaan ottamiseen.","sv":"Gymnasiet ordnar undervisning på finska.","en":"Haukilahti general upper secondary school has ca. 350 students. We are involved in several international and national projects. Our broad language selection, versatile course offerings in social and health studies, history, religion/ethics and science and mathematics studies combined with art and physical education create the students an excellent foundation for suceeding in the matriculation examination as well as in further studies.\n\nOur school has a separate sports programme. The sports programme is meant for students who have set high goals for both developing their skills in their sports discipline and for succeeding in theri studies. The sports focus on golf, football, ice-hockey and gymnastics."},"short_description":{"fi":"Haukilahden lukio on uudenlaisia, oppiainerajatkin ylittäviä opetusmenetelmiä ja joustavia tilaratkaisuja tarjoava lukio, jossa on myös urheilulinja.","sv":"Gymnasiet ordnar undervisning på finska.","en":"Haukilahti general upper secondary school has ca. 350 students. We are involved in several international and national projects."},"name":{"fi":"Haukilahden lukio","sv":"Haukilahden lukio","en":"Haukilahden lukio"},"street_address":{"fi":"Tekniikantie 3","sv":"Teknikvägen 3","en":"Tekniikantie 3"},"www":{"fi":"https://www.espoo.fi/fi/haukilahden-lukio","sv":"https://www.espoo.fi/fi/haukilahden-lukio","en":"https://www.espoo.fi/fi/haukilahden-lukio"},"address_postal_full":{"fi":"PL 3238, 02070 ESPOON KAUPUNKI","sv":"PB 3238, 02070 ESBO STAD","en":"P.O. Box 3238, 02070 ESPOO CITY"},"call_charge_info":{"fi":"pvm/mpm","sv":"lna/msa","en":"local network charge/mobile call charge"},"displayed_service_owner":{"fi":"kunnallinen palvelu, Kasvun ja oppimisen toimiala, Espoo","sv":"kommunal tjänst, Sektorn för fostran och lärande, Esbo","en":"municipal service, Growth and Learning Sector, Espoo"},"displayed_service_owner_type":"MUNICIP